        {
          "exampleId": "w:match#e-0a76ce1a1c61e7fd",
          "text": "As fate（命运） would have it, Dr. Henderson very deliberately matched everyone in class and announced that I would be working with the one person in class I wanted to avoid.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan",
