            "start": 59,
            "end": 66
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:match#e-af871451f7225375",
          "text": "Led by the concept of “right plant, right place,” they match plants that enjoy the same soil, sun and weather conditions, and arrange them according to their patterns of growth.",
